"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良くしてもらってた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉ちゃんみたいな存在で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は心から頼りにしていたし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきだったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんが卒業を話してくれなかったのがすごく悔しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、らりんさんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の卒業発表のせいで悲しくて泣いてしまうステージじゃなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆んなが頑張ってきてやっと来れた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武道館のステージを悔いなく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全力でやってほしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という、らりんさんの優しさで溢れた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思いがあったことをし知りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりんさんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人に頼ることが苦手で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何でも自分の中で解決しようとしちゃう事が多かったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからの永島聖羅さんには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後輩の私にも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと頼ってほしいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか永島聖羅さんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブに来てくれた時には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「北野、成長したね！えらいえらいっ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってもらえるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで私が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「らりんさんっ！私、こんなに成長しましたよ」って言えるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっともーっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きくなります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1公演目で披露した"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんとの無表情！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんが私と二人でやりたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とスタッフさんに言ってくださり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんと二人で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージ上で無表情を歌える事ができました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちはスマイル姉妹です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スマイル姉妹の無表情。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は最後まで笑わないように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真顔を貫こうとしましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真顔で笑わせようとしてくるらりんさんのせいで、いつのまにか怒り顔でやってました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんの存在は大きいとわかっていましたが、私の想像や感覚よりももっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きすぎる太陽でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな大きすぎる太陽に負けないように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"t